roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1463053642,"text":"Ooh, Paimon knows! She must have been telling the person sitting on the ground a story before they went to bed. That's the kind of picture this is!","nextNodeIds":[790330104]},{"nodeId":790330104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3632427098,"text":"Do Fatui listen to bedtime stories too?","nextNodeIds":[790330105]},{"nodeId":790330105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":616014170,"text":"You never know.","nextNodeIds":[790330106]},{"nodeId":790330106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":267731970,"text":"Agafya, Persikov has ordered us to perform some signal reception tests. Looks like all four of us have to go... Chevka will probably get mad at me.","nextNodeIds":[790330107]},{"nodeId":790330107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2923694242,"text":"Come on, Yakov, orders are orders, Chevka isn't going to blame you for them!","nextNodeIds":[790330108]},{"nodeId":790330108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4241940970,"text":"...You know what, if you're that scared, I'll go with you to talk to Chevka, alright?","nextNodeIds":[790330109]},{"nodeId":790330109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":553155850,"text":"Huh, so she wasn't telling a story after all...","nextNodeIds":[790330110]},{"nodeId":790330110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":241993450,"text":"But this snippet just kinda comes outta nowhere. We can't tell what's going on at all...","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7903301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["9","199